Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  我看到保时捷停在前门口\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey uh Mon, I saw the Porsche parked out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙能借我一下吗  我想带那个坏男孩出去兜几圈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I get the keys? Thought I'll take that bad boy out for a little spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.67,0:00:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  罗斯可以开  我问你时  你说只有你能开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute! You let Ross drive the Porsche and when I ask you, you say you're the only one who's allowed to drive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我哥哥啊  而且他开的很慢   不会出事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, well he's my brother, And plus he drives so slow he couldn't never hurt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是辆车  摩妮卡  不是火箭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a car, Monica, not a rocket ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.77,0:00:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便啦  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whatever, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兜完风后  帮我换一下煞车灯的灯泡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just replace the bulbs in the brake lights after you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.77,0:00:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到保时捷了  真的很酷  我什么时候能再开出去兜风啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Saw the Porsche  out there Mon, Looking good. When do I get to take that baby out again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你让乔伊开保时捷  我从来没开过  一次都没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You let Joey drive it? I've never driven it. Okay? Not once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.71,0:00:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  只有一次  好吧  我常常开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, once. Okay, I drive it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢大家  "你可以开  但别告诉瑞秋" 计划宣告失败\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice work everybody! So much for the y'know, "you can drive it but don't tell Rachel" plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.42,0:00:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  真不敢相信你们骗我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, I can't believe you lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.68,0:01:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事交给我来吧  摩妮卡  瑞秋认为你脑子里只想着婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I can fix this. Okay Monica, Rachel thinks all you can talk about is the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.93,0:01:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我不让你开保时捷  是因为你是个糟糕的司机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great! Well Rachel, the reason why I won't let you drive the Porsche is because you're a terrible driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.69,0:01:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样   跟婚礼无关吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There. That wasn't about the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.07,0:01:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  如果你想坐保时捷去兜风  我可以带你在附近转转\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look Rach if-if you want to go for a ride in the Porsche, I’ll be glad to take you for a quick spin around the block.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有几个小时吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you got a couple hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.28,0:01:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第七季  第22集  钱德之父\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S07E22  The One With Chandler's Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.09,0:01:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.01,0:01:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.31,0:01:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.99,0:02:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  兜风真痛快啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whew, that was a brisk ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你敞开了篷跑  对不对  这样才能感觉在飞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take the top down, did you? Only way to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯把钥匙给我  摩妮卡错了  我是个很棒的司机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on Ross give me the keys. Monica does not know what she's talking about! I'm an excellent driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你开的又快又不可靠  结论就是一个差司机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're fast and irresponsible. That adds up to a bad driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.63,0:02:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高中时  我那些特点让我当上了啦啦队长\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well in high school, that added up to head cheerleader.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.35,0:02:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有看到那个女孩在注视着我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you see the look that girl just gave me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.14,0:02:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她一定看到了我开保时捷兜风的帅样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She must've seen me cruising in the bad boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.94,0:02:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想她在看你的一头乱鸡窝  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think she's checking out your beehive Ross. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梳子给我  钥匙给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Give me a brush. Give me the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.57,0:02:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  那就不给梳子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No way! Well, no brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine. Y'know what? It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.37,0:02:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我没记错  洗手间地上有一把梳子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}because, if I remember correctly, there's a comb on the floor of the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.34,0:03:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离婚赡养费\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Alimony.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你爸还没寄回函给我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, we still haven't gotten an RSVP from your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.23,0:03:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  对啊  也许是因为我没有寄给他邀请信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, right. Urn, maybe that's because I didn't send him an invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.15,0:03:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  他是你父亲呀  他应该出席我们的婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, he's your father. He should be at your wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至不认得他  我们不亲  我好几年没跟他见过面了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't even know the man. Okay? We're not the close.I haven't seen him in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他知道我们没有邀请他呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well what are you gonna do when he finds out he wasn't even asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他又不会知道  我们的生活圈不一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well he doesn't have to know! It's not like we run in the same circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你们混在一起  而他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hang out with you guys and he...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.83,0:03:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在拉斯维加斯表演变装秀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...stars in a drag show in Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想和他交换生活圈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, I think I want to trade circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  你不会想邀请他来  没有人会看新娘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Trust me, you don't want him there either. Okay? Nobody is gonna be stare at the bride...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为新郎的爸爸穿着露背洋装\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...when the groom's father's wearing a back-less dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.89,0:03:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要他不穿婚纱  我根本不在乎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As long as he's not wearing a white dress and a veil, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我得去买点东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I think I need to do some shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你在做什么  我只是在清洗挡风玻璃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you think you're doing? Just washing the windshield.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.79,0:04:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会让你开这辆车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's no way I am letting you drive this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.01,0:04:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把钥匙还给我吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So why don't you just hand over the keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.26,0:04:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不要启动车子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No ah-ah-ah! Do not start this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我给你二十块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay. I will give you 2O bucks...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.85,0:04:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你立刻下车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...if you get out of this car right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  如果你真的那么害怕  就上车吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, If you're so freaked out, just get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.57,0:04:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你一起去兜风  是噢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}With you? Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.45,0:04:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吧  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么  坐到前面来  要我坐死亡座椅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing? Get in front. In the death seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  大家好  嗨  甜心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guys. Hi, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.30,0:05:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗  我的皮包在摩妮卡家  我去拿回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ready to go? Yeah! Sure! Ooh, I left my purse up at Monica's. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.80,0:05:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.26,0:05:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.85,0:05:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还在头晕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, oh, that one kept going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟菲比在交往\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, you and Phoebe, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.24,0:05:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交往多久了  一个多月了把\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How long have you been going out? Over a month
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该彼此多多了解\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. Maybe uh, maybe you and I ought to get to know each other a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.99,0:05:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我很愿意  对嘛  所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. I'd like that. Yeah. So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.33,0:05:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.59,0:05:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是杰克  我是乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's Jake. Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克  你喜欢《尼克队》吗  当然  忠实球迷呀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey Jake, Do you like the Knicks? Yeah, big fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是  星期二有比赛  想去吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me too. There's a game on Tuesday. Do you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  我得先确定星期二我没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah that would be great! Let me make sure I'm not doing anything Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.31,0:06:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿去吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.19,0:06:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么  你的行李  我们要去拉斯维加斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's this? It's your suitcase. We're going to Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.90,0:06:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  要私奔吗  不必再筹备那个该死的婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you serious? I mean like eloping?! No more stupid wedding stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.16,0:06:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不必再烦恼这些花或那些花  想想这样我们能省多少钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No more these flowers, or these flowers or these flowers— Think of the money we'll save.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.79,0:06:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是私奔  我喜欢花  我们的婚礼能再盛大一点吗  拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're not eloping. I love the flowers. Can our wedding be bigger, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.71,0:06:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要去拉斯维加斯找你爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're going to Las Vegas to see your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.75,0:06:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们该聚一聚了  我也想认识我公公\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's time you two talked, and I want to get to know my father-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经谈过这事了  我赢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know we already went over this and I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你没赢  甜心  你应该知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, you didn't. Oh and honey, just so you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是你要娶我  你就赢不了的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now that you're marrying me, you don't get to win anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是算了吧  我不想去  我不想见到他  我不想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look forget it okay? I don't want to go. I don't want to see him. I don't wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  我知道你爸让你觉得丢脸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, look I-I know that your dad embarrassed you. I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  所有的小孩  都会觉得自己的父母很丢脸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No-no all kids are embarrassed by their parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.87,0:06:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该多知道一些我的经历\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you'd have to come up with a whole new word for what I went through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高中的时候  他参加了我所有的游泳比赛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I was in high school, he used to come to all my swim meets...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每次都装扮成不同的好莱坞明星\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...dressed as a different Hollywood starlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对于我14的人来说是很痛苦的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's hard enough to be 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.28,0:06:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瘦巴巴的  连紧身泳裤都太大  你妈妈保证说有一天你会长大成熟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're skinny, You're wearing Speedos--That your morn promised you'd grow into.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要是往好的方面看  那是你爸爸给你加油\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You look up in the stands. There's your dad cheering you on.
