Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.69,0:14:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弹钢琴的人就是嘉利巴迪老师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's Mr. Garibaldi playing the piano.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For I'm loved
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}By a pretty wonderful boy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.25,0:14:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  欢迎大家来看表演\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, and welcome to the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在观众席中我看到一些常客\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I see some of our regulars in the audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.26,0:14:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一些新面孔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And a couple of irregulars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他要走进观众席里了  别紧张  没什么大不了的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's coming into the audience. He's coming into the audience. Relax. You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.89,0:14:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  好多了  现在你成了隐形人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, much better. You're invisible now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是从哪里来的  贝克斯菲德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where are you from'? Bakersfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  贝克斯菲德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry? Bakersfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  我听到了  我只是觉得很遗憾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, I heard. I'm just sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法接受这种事情  我们回饭店碰面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It can't happen like this. Okay? I'll meet you back at the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.16,0:15:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家看  已经有人站起来鼓掌了  演出才开始呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh Look, a standing ovation already. So early in the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.62,0:15:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,转身吧  小亲亲  让我看看你帅气的脸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh turn around, darling. Let me see your pretty face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.72,0:15:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的饮料能快点送上来吗  服务生  女招待\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can we have our drinks, please? Uh, waiter? --tress?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.52,0:15:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  菲比  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.91,0:15:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我多有男子气概\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How much of a man am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  太棒了  很有男性味  还有点点放荡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, nice. Manly, and also kind of a slut.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我开始明白杰克的意思了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I'm beginning to see what Jake was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.34,0:16:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真丝内裤的感觉真的很舒服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh. The silk feels really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.59,0:16:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而那玩意儿不像我想像中那样  会挤成一团\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And things aren't as smashed down as I thought they would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.64,0:16:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.01,0:16:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且男人的内裤选择也没那么多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! And you have so many more choices than you do with men's underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.93,0:16:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比基尼  三角裤  丁字裤  质料还有棉  丝跟蕾丝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bikini, French cut, thong. And the fabrics: You've got cotton, silk, lace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.52,0:16:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我一直想穿什么吗  裤袜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you know what I've always wondered about? Pantyhose!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从脚趾头开始一路往上拉到这儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know? The way they start at your toe and go all the way up to here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该把内裤脱下来  对吧  我想你最好脱下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I should go take these off off shouldn't I? I think it's important that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.22,0:16:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的名字真是与众不同\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What an unusual name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的父母一定是很精采的人物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You must have had terribly fascinating parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.22,0:17:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  他们很有趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, they're a hoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.31,0:17:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的朋友叫什么名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And who is your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  你们从哪里来的  纽约\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica. Where are you from? New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.65,0:17:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不太喜欢纽约\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not very fond of New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我喜欢皇后区\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Queens, I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.28,0:17:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个亮晶晶的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, what is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,东西是什么啊  甜心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...sparkling something, honey, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.96,0:17:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  摩妮卡跟我已经订婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, Monica and I are engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.96,0:17:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.26,0:17:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们什么时候结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When's the big day?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.60,0:17:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两星期后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In...in two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.60,0:17:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.52,0:17:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  祝你们两个永远幸福\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I wish you both a lifetime of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.98,0:17:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来你是个秃头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you're bald.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.48,0:17:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.74,0:17:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们希望你能来参加我们的婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'd really love it if you could be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  那会让我很快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know it would make me happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.33,0:18:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,夫人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我一定会去的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then I wouldn't miss it for the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.47,0:18:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都热泪盈眶了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I'm getting all misty here. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.39,0:18:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们一定会以为  我刚刚用热蜡除过腿毛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You'd think I was having my legs waxed or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.89,0:18:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗  我很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You okay? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.85,0:18:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你逼我这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks for making me do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.11,0:18:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在继续表演前  我要跟这对新人说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Before we go on with the show, I just want to say to the bride and groom...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们非常幸运能找到彼此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...how lucky they are to have found each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.32,0:18:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人的人生都会遇到雨天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In every life a little rain must fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fortunately...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我的人生中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...in my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.42,0:18:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's raining men
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.63,0:18:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hallelujah
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.42,0:18:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it's raining men, uh-huh Amen
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.55,0:19:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候演过最左边那个角色\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I was growing up, I played the one on the far left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it's raining men, amen
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,提醒我介绍你给某人认识\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Remind me to introduce you to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁  四档\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who? Fourth gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.99,0:19:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他想做什么  我什么都没做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What does he want? I wasn't doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许他看到你的手  不小心从十点和两点的位置滑下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well maybe he saw your hands slip briefly from the 10 and 2:00 position.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.63,0:19:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许是射手座警官  返回来想泡你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe it's, uh, Sergeant Sagittarius coming back to flirt some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是刚刚那个警官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a different guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.39,0:19:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚安  警官  你知道你的时速有多快吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good evening, officer. Do you know how fast you were going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.31,0:19:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不知道  但应该没有超过60英哩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, no, I don't, but it could not have been more than 60.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.27,0:19:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对  只有37英哩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right. It was 37.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.03,0:20:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会因为我开得太慢  要开我罚单吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean you're not gonna give me ticketing for driving too slow, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.49,0:20:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.88,0:20:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的  警官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, officer, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.13,0:20:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚我做了一个非常奇怪的梦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had the weirdest dream last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦你把驾照拿出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your license, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.68,0:20:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不想听听我做了什么梦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't want to hear about my dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.23,0:20:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Officer...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.94,0:20:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮警官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.90,0:20:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是佩堤警官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's Petty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.11,0:20:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去开罚单  马上回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll be right back with your ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有个儿子  我知道  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have a son. I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.25,0:20:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,觉得好点了吗  我好多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Feel better? Yeah. Much. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.59,0:21:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是想证明我的男子气概\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not that I'm y'know insecure about my manhood or anything y'know, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.93,0:21:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我觉得我需要马上去泡个女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I think I need to hook up with a woman right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我了解  好  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I understand. Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你好  你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.82,0:21:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来好眼熟  我认识你吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}y'know, You look familiar. Do I know you from somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.57,0:21:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该不认识\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许是因为我是电视演员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! Maybe it's because I'm on television.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.62,0:21:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在《我们的日子》里演出  哇  真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm an actor on Days of our Lives. Wow. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一共是$4.50   谢谢  喔  让我来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Four-fifty, please. Oh, let me get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.47,0:21:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是送你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}These are for you.
